3) Framework Integration 4) Easy Testing 5) Web MVC Framework 6) Centralized Exception Handling 7) Lightweight Containers

Basics of Spring: 
- Reduces boilerplate code using Dependency Injection and AOP for faster, cleaner development.
- Loose Coupling - Modular: Allows using only required modules - Integration Support and scalability

